        "cooked": "<p>Wow, Christopher. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/clap.png?v=12\" title=\":clap:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":clap:\"> Amazing story. I am impressed and glad you were able to help all those people.</p>",
