        "created_at": "2022-12-19T00:49:24.530Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It does seem like for some reason you need to choose Download This Episode if you listen via the Libsyn page, but otherwise the episode is there.</p>\n<p>And the reason there seems to be no Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#57</span> thread is because the title was misnumbered: <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/editor-s-note-56/29499\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Editor’s Note #56</a></p>",
